<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49635" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θώς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θωός, ὁ</span>, also ἡ, prob. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>jackal, Canis
				aureus</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τρῶες ἕπονθ᾽ ὡς εἴ τε δαφοινοὶ θῶες
					. . ἀμφ᾽ ἔλαφον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.474
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				610a14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				630a9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θώων παρδαλίων τε λύκων τ᾽ ἤϊα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.103
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. καὶ πάνθηρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.192
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχει ὁ θ. πάντα τὰ ἐντὸς ὅμοια
					λύκῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					507b17
				</span></i>
			; a large kind in India, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				15.3
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θώαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1302
				</span></i>
			 (mosaic at Praeneste). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hunting dog, Lycaon pictus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.338
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>panther</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cyr.
			</span></i></div>
